    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i had a weird thing happen just now. i stood up to grab something and everything just went black for a few seconds, i felt really lightheaded and then i was just... out. i'm 72, nothing new really, just a bit tired lately. i think i might just be dehydrated or something, should i just drink some more water and lie down for a bit? or is this something i should worry about?",
